{"id":"vod_bf_42849","vodId":"42849","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"一拳超人第一季","name_cn":"一拳超人第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/a90a0fc15f3858b924b99952752233a4.jpg"},"summary":"曾经，埼玉（古川慎 配音）只是一介平凡的上班族，某日，在偶然之中遇见了遭到变种螃蟹攻击的少年，心中升腾起了正义之感，对其出手相救。就此之后，埼玉幼年时代的英雄梦想在内心里死灰复燃，为了变得更加强大，埼玉开始了艰苦的训练，一晃眼数年过去，他仿佛脱胎换骨般的获得了异常强大的力量，但却付出了变成光头的代价。　　由于埼玉的力量实在是过于强大，无论面对如何可怕的敌人，都只需一拳就能分出胜负。之后，埼玉遇见了名为杰诺斯（石川界人 配音）的改造人，后者在领略了埼玉的绝对强大之后拜其为师。与此同时，埼玉和杰诺斯报名加入了英雄协会，成为了真真正正有名有号的英雄，就此开始了打击罪恶之旅。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:08:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yiquanchaorendiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:04.663Z"}